title: 주4_목_2교시_도서관_양나현_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle>>
(As I enter the library, I see NaHyun and take a seat next to her.)
{name()}: Hey, NaHyun.
NaHyun: Hey.
(NaHyun is watching a video on her phone.)
(It looks like a cat video.)
{name()}: You really do love cats, don't you?
NaHyun: Yeah. They're cute, and...
NaHyun: Sometimes they have a bit of an attitude...
NaHyun: I think the way you can never quite tell what they're thinking is charming.
{name()}: They say cats are the ones who choose their owners, right?
NaHyun: Exactly. That's why people call themselves "butlers"...
(Listening to her, I feel like she reminds me of a certain someone...)
<<choice 주4_목_2교시_도서관_양나현_긍정1_영문 "Well, if I ever get the chance...?" 주4_목_2교시_도서관_부정1_영문 "Hmm... I haven't really thought about it.">>
NaHyun: Would you ever want to raise a cat?
===

title: 주4_목_2교시_도서관_양나현_긍정1_영문
---
<<show hyun_smile>>
<<change lvHyun +5>>
<<like 양나현>>
{name()}: I'm just not sure if a cat would ever choose me.
<<if get("lvHyun") >= 70>>
    <<jump 주4_목_2교시_도서관_호감도_영문>>
<<else>>
    NaHyun: Why? Have some confidence.
    NaHyun: Maybe cats like humans who are obedient...
    <<play 양나현_웃음>>
    <<jump 주4_목_2교시_도서관_분기1_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 주4_목_2교시_도서관_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: Hmm... I don't know.
{name()}: I'm not sure I'm up for it. I don't know if a cat would ever pick me.
<<if get("lvHyun") >= 70>>
    <<jump 주4_목_2교시_도서관_호감도_영문>>
<<else>>
    NaHyun: Why? Have some confidence.
    NaHyun: Maybe cats like humans who are obedient...
    <<play 양나현_웃음>>
    <<jump 주4_목_2교시_도서관_분기1_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 주4_목_2교시_도서관_호감도_영문
---
NaHyun: Why not?
<<show hyun_blush>>
NaHyun: Look around you.
NaHyun: You might have been chosen already...
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
<<jump 주4_목_2교시_도서관_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주4_목_2교시_도서관_분기1_영문
---
NaHyun: There's a story that cats are the only animals that devils actually like.
{name()}: Oh... really?
NaHyun: I saw it on TubeTube.
NaHyun: Believe it or not, of course.
{name()}: I guess they do fit the devilish vibe. Especially black cats.
(We chatted a bit more about cats.)
<<end>>
===